"还记得 {doc}`../pytorch-practice/train-workflow` 中那个 MNIST 分类器吗？用 60,000 "
"张图片训练，效果不错。但如果你的任务只有 **100 张医学影像**，还能训练出好模型吗？**迁移学习就是答案。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:6
msgid "学习目标"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:9
msgid "完成本章后，你将能够："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:10
msgid "**理解迁移学习的核心思想**：解释为什么需要迁移学习，掌握领域与任务的基本定义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:11
msgid "**掌握分类体系**：区分归纳式、直推式、无监督迁移学习，理解四种迁移方法的技术路线"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:12
msgid "**熟练运用核心技术**：正确选择并实施特征提取与微调策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:13
msgid "**避免实践陷阱**：识别并解决灾难性遗忘、过拟合等常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:14
msgid "**完成实际项目**：根据任务特点选择合适的预训练模型和迁移策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:17
msgid "什么是迁移学习？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:19
msgid "站在巨人的肩膀上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:21
msgid "**类比1：学习乐器**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:23
msgid "想象你已经学会了钢琴（源任务）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:24
msgid "你理解乐谱、节奏、和声"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:25
msgid "你的手指已经训练出协调性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:27
msgid "现在你要学小提琴（目标任务）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:28
msgid "**没有迁移**：从头学乐理、识谱、音准——需要数年"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:29
msgid "**有迁移**：乐理知识直接用，只需适应新的演奏方式——数月即可"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:31
msgid "迁移学习就像音乐技能的迁移——底层知识（乐理）通用，只需调整表层技巧（演奏方式）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:33
msgid "**类比2：视觉识别**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:35
msgid "预训练模型在 ImageNet（1000类自然图像）上训练后："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:36
msgid "学会了识别**边缘**（直线、曲线）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:37
msgid "学会了识别**纹理**（皮毛、金属、织物）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:38
msgid "学会了识别**形状**（圆形、方形、不规则）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:40
msgid "这些能力对医学影像同样有用："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:41
msgid "X光片的**边缘**帮助定位器官边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:42
msgid "CT扫描的**纹理**帮助区分组织类型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:43
msgid "肿瘤的**形状**帮助判断良恶性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:45
msgid "**核心洞察**：预训练模型学到的不是\"猫狗分类\"，而是\"看世界的通用方式\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:47
msgid "信息流动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:65
msgid "知识从海量数据流向预训练模型，再迁移到目标任务，**信息逐渐从通用走向特定**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:67
msgid "**关键洞察**：预训练模型像是\"知识压缩机\"，把1400万张图片的信息压缩到2500万参数中。迁移学习时，我们只需微调这个压缩表示，而不需要重新学习所有知识。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:69
msgid "形式化定义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:71
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"迁移学习的核心思想是：利用源领域（Source Domain）$D_s$ 和源任务（Source Task）$T_s$ "
"中学到的知识，来帮助目标领域（Target Domain）$D_t$ 和目标任务（Target Task）$T_t$ 的学习 "
"{cite}`pan2010survey`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{目标：} \\text{利用 } D_s \\text{ 和 } T_s \\text{ 的知识，提升在 } D_t \\text{"
" 上学习 } T_t \\text{ 的性能}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:78
msgid "**关键假设**：源领域数据量远大于目标领域（$n_s \\gg n_t$）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:80
msgid "核心概念：领域与任务"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:82
msgid "理解迁移学习需要明确两个基本概念。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:84
msgid "领域（Domain）= 数据的\"世界\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:86
msgid "**直觉理解**：想象你在学画画。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:87
msgid "**源领域**：你在美术课上画水果（苹果、香蕉）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:88
msgid "**目标领域**：现在要画医学解剖图（心脏、肺部）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:90
msgid "虽然都是画画（特征空间相同，都是图像），但**画风完全不同**（数据分布不同）——水果是彩色的、光滑的；解剖图是黑白的、复杂的。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:92
msgid "**数学上**，领域 = 特征空间 + 数据分布："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:93
msgid "**特征空间**：数据的表现形式（如224×224的RGB图像）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:94
msgid "**数据分布**：这些数据实际长什么样（自然照片 vs 医学影像）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "对比项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "源领域（ImageNet）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "目标领域（医学影像）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "特征空间"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "都是224×224 RGB图像"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "数据分布"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "自然风景、动物、物品"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "X光片、CT扫描"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "**直觉**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "照片风格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:73
msgid "黑白影像风格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:102
msgid "任务（Task）= 要解决的问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:104
msgid "**直觉理解**：同样的数据，可以有不同的任务。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:105
msgid "**源任务**：这张图片是猫还是狗？（1000类分类）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:106
msgid "**目标任务**：这张X光片显示肺炎了吗？（2类分类）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:108
msgid "领域偏移（Domain Shift）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:110
msgid "**生活中的例子**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:111
msgid "假设你学会了识别\"水果照片中的苹果\"。现在给你看\"素描画中的苹果\"，虽然都是苹果，但风格完全不同——这就是领域偏移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:113
msgid "**为什么会出现这个问题？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:114
msgid "预训练模型学会了\"识别照片中的物体\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:115
msgid "但医学影像是\"识别黑白影像中的病理特征\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:116
msgid "**底层技巧相通**（边缘检测、形状识别），但**表现形式不同**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:118
msgid "**解决方案**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:119
msgid "保留底层技巧（浅层特征）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:120
msgid "调整顶层策略（分类层）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:121
msgid "这就是**微调**的核心思想"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:125
msgid "**一句话总结**：迁移学习就是「用学画水果的技巧，快速学会画解剖图」——基础技能相通，只需调整应用方式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:127
msgid "迁移学习的效果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:129
msgid "大量实践表明，迁移学习能够带来显著的性能提升："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:131
#, python-brace-format
msgid "ImageNet预训练的ResNet模型，迁移到下游视觉任务平均提升 **5-20%** 准确率 {cite}`he2016deep`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:132
#, python-brace-format
msgid "BERT通过大规模预训练，在11项NLP任务上刷新了SOTA {cite}`devlin2018bert`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:133
msgid "医学影像领域，迁移学习可将小样本任务准确率从40-50%提升至80-90%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:135
msgid "为什么需要迁移学习？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:137
msgid "数据困境"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:139
msgid "深度学习模型的性能往往依赖于**海量标注数据**。然而在实际应用中，我们经常面临数据稀缺的挑战："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:141
msgid "**医疗影像**：罕见疾病样本往往仅有数百例，难以从零训练深度网络"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:142
msgid "**工业缺陷检测**：优质生产线很少产生缺陷样本，缺陷数据极为稀少"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:143
msgid "**小众语言**：绝大多数语言缺乏足够的数字化文本资源"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:145
msgid "此外，特定领域的数据常因隐私或商业原因难以汇聚，形成\"数据孤岛\"问题。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:147
msgid "计算成本"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:149
msgid "训练具有竞争力的深度学习模型需要巨大的计算投入。ResNet-50训练成本约数百美元，而GPT-3等大模型则需数千万美元。对于大多数研究团队和企业，从头训练既不现实也无必要。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:151
msgid "过拟合风险"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:153
msgid "小数据集上从头训练深度网络极易导致**过拟合**——模型\"记住\"训练样本而非学习通用规律。迁移学习通过引入预训练知识，相当于为模型提供了强大的\"先验正则化\"，有效缓解这一问题。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:155
msgid "人类学习的启示"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:157
msgid "人类天然具备知识迁移的能力：会骑自行车的人学摩托车更容易，掌握Python后学习JavaScript事半功倍。迁移学习正是将这一思想引入深度学习——利用在一个领域学到的知识，帮助解决另一个领域的问题。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:159
msgid "迁移学习的适用场景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:161
msgid "迁移学习特别适用于以下场景："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:163
msgid "**目标领域数据稀缺**：标注数据难以获取或成本高昂"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:164
msgid "**快速原型验证**：需要在短时间内建立baseline模型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:165
msgid "**计算资源受限**：无法承担从头训练大模型的成本"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:166
msgid "**领域间存在关联**：源任务与目标任务有一定相似性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:168
msgid "何时不适用？负迁移（Negative Transfer）详解"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:171
msgid "当源领域与目标领域完全无关时，强行迁移可能导致**负迁移**——迁移后性能比从头训练还差。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:173
msgid "**负迁移发生的条件**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:175
msgid "**领域差异过大**：源域和目标域的底层特征完全不同"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:176
msgid "❌ 用自然图像模型处理基因组序列"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:177
msgid "❌ 用文本模型处理音频信号"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:179
msgid "**任务冲突**：源任务和目标任务的要求相互矛盾"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:180
msgid "❌ 用\"识别猫狗\"的模型做\"识别猫的品种\"（粒度差异过大）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:182
msgid "**数学解释**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:184
msgid "负迁移发生时，源域知识反而成为噪声："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:186
msgid "\\text{Performance}_{\\text{迁移}} < \\text{Performance}_{\\text{从头训练}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:188
msgid "**如何避免负迁移**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:190
msgid "**领域相似性判断**：用预训练模型提取目标域特征，看是否能较好分离"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:191
msgid "**渐进式实验**：先尝试特征提取，效果不佳则考虑从头训练"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:192
msgid "**可视化分析**：用t-SNE可视化源域和目标域的特征分布，看是否有重叠"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:194
msgid "**负迁移 vs 性能提升有限**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:195
msgid "负迁移：性能**下降**（有害）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:196
msgid "性能提升有限：性能**上升但不多**（无害但帮助不大）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:199
msgid "本章小结"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:201
msgid "**动机**：解决数据稀缺、计算成本高、小样本过拟合等问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:202
msgid "**定义**：利用源领域知识提升目标领域学习性能的范式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:203
msgid "**核心**：领域（特征空间+分布）与任务（标签空间+预测函数）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:204
msgid "**直觉**：像学乐器一样迁移底层知识，像\"看世界\"一样复用通用特征"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:206
msgid "下一步"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:208
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"理解了迁移学习的基本概念后，{doc}`part2-taxonomy` "
"我们将建立一套**分类体系**，帮助你在面对具体问题时快速找到合适的方法——归纳式、直推式、无监督迁移学习，哪种适合你的任务？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part1-intro.md:214
msgid "参考文献"
msgstr ""

